00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:11,400
I'm Doctor Gainz. Lesson 23: Evaluate
costs before offering a

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:16,240
service. A responsible business plan
includes training time, secure tools,

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,520
administrative work, professional review,
permitted marketing, and the

6
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,780
possibility that no paid work results.

7
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,940
A potential case amount is not your
revenue.

8
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:30,440
Your compensation depends on lawful,
reviewed arrangements and actual

9
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:32,460
completed work under those arrangements.

10
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:37,240
For a fictional budgeting exercise, assume
two hundred dollars of tools and

11
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,880
three hundred dollars of other fixed
monthly costs.

12
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:44,480
At a hypothetical two hundred fifty
dollars contribution after case-specific

13
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:48,680
costs, two completed paid services would
cover those fixed costs

14
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:52,380
arithmetically. This is a break-even
illustration only.

15
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:56,380
It supplies no evidence of customer
demand, permitted fee levels,

16
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:59,680
