earnings.

17
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:03,400
Research local limitations before
committing to spending.

18
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:08,140
Keep an explicit stop condition for a
model that is restricted, uneconomic,

19
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,980
or dependent on unsupported income claims.

20
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:15,020
Learning a skill does not create a
guaranteed market for it.

21
