25
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:29,740
Quick knowledge check. What does the
break-even example establish?

26
00:01:30,660 --> 00:01:34,980
The answer: An arithmetic relationship
under stated fictional assumptions.

27
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:40,300
Business arithmetic is not evidence of
lawful pricing, demand, or future

28
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:44,560
